<title>FINLAND: HPY JAN-APRIL PRE-TAX PROFIT RISES TO FIM 60 MLN.</title>
<headline>HPY JAN-APRIL PRE-TAX PROFIT RISES TO FIM 60 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to April 30,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax	60 vs 21</p>
<p> Net sales					    793 vs 675</p>
<p> Operating profit				    67 vs 33</p>
